<mxCell id="rules" value="&lt;b&gt;Domain rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• A booking can have several assignments over time, with at most one active assignment.&lt;br&gt;• Each trip milestone has a timestamp. Examples: OTW, Waiting, Pickup and Drop.&lt;br&gt;• Each notification has one recipient, either a customer or a driver.&lt;br&gt;• For a corporate booking, a purchase order follows quotation approval. An invoice follows booking confirmation." style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#BFDBFE;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="895" width="750" height="148" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
